Package: dsGeospatial
Title: Privacy-Preserving Geospatial Analysis in DataSHIELD
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Theertha", "Kariyathan", , "Theertha.Kariyathan@liverpool.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides privacy-preserving methods for the visualisation and
    analysis of linked health and environmental data using the DataSHIELD
    framework. Individual-level and household-level data
    remain within the data-holding organisations, while only disclosure-
    controlled aggregate results are returned to the analyst. The package is
    being developed as part of the GROVE project within the DARE UK programme.
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a
    license
